# 06 · Cheminformatics

**EN** — Parse molecules from SMILES, depict them in 2-D, compute drug-likeness descriptors, and compare a small set of drugs side by side.

**ID** — Mengurai molekul dari SMILES, menggambarnya dalam 2-D, menghitung deskriptor kemiripan obat (drug-likeness), dan membandingkan sekumpulan kecil obat secara berdampingan.

*Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil*

#!csharp

#r "nuget: Gravicode.Biotech.Net.Notebooks, 0.2.0"
// Local build instead of NuGet (run `dotnet build Biotech.Net.slnx` first), comment the line above and use:
// #r "../src/Biotech.Net.Notebooks/bin/Debug/net10.0/Biotech.Net.Notebooks.dll"

#!csharp

using Biotech.Net.Chemistry;
using Biotech.Net.Visualization;
using Biotech.Net.Notebooks;

BiotechFormatters.Register();

#!markdown

## One molecule · Satu molekul

The formatter shows the 2-D depiction, SMILES and key descriptors.
Formatter menampilkan gambar 2-D, SMILES, dan deskriptor utama.

#!csharp

var aspirin = Molecule.FromSmiles("CC(=O)Oc1ccccc1C(=O)O", "aspirin");
aspirin

#!csharp

MolecularDescriptors.Compute(aspirin)

#!markdown

## Custom depiction · Gambar kustom

#!csharp

new MoleculeViewer(Molecule.FromSmiles("Cn1cnc2c1c(=O)n(C)c(=O)n2C", "caffeine"), 480, 360)
{
    ShowAtomIndices = true,
    HighlightAtoms = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4],
    Theme = BioTheme.Dark,
}

#!markdown

## A small drug panel · Panel obat kecil

#!csharp

var drugs = new (string Name, string Smiles)[]
{
    ("ibuprofen", "CC(C)Cc1ccc(cc1)C(C)C(=O)O"),
    ("paracetamol", "CC(=O)Nc1ccc(O)cc1"),
    ("caffeine", "Cn1cnc2c1c(=O)n(C)c(=O)n2C"),
    ("metformin", "CN(C)C(=N)NC(=N)N"),
    ("nicotine", "CN1CCC[C@H]1c1cccnc1"),
};
var molecules = drugs.Select(d => Molecule.FromSmiles(d.Smiles, d.Name)).ToList();

var table = molecules.Select(m => MolecularDescriptors.Compute(m)).Select((d, i) => new
{
    molecule = molecules[i].Name,
    d.Formula,
    MW = Math.Round(d.MolecularWeight, 2),
    LogP = Math.Round(d.LogP, 2),
    TPSA = Math.Round(d.Tpsa, 1),
    HBD = d.HBondDonors,
    HBA = d.HBondAcceptors,
    Lipinski = DrugLikeness.Lipinski(d).ToString(),
});
table

#!csharp

molecules.Select(m => HTML(new MoleculeViewer(m, 260, 200).ToHtml(interactive: false)))
